Title,Priority,Area,Description
Create User Profile,P0,Profile,Allow the user to create a personal profile on first launch.
Edit User Profile,P0,Profile,Allow the user to update profile information.
Update Profile Picture,P2,Profile,Allow the user to add or change a profile picture.
Remove Profile Picture,P2,Profile,Allow the user to remove the current profile picture.
View User Profile,P0,Profile,Display the user's profile information.
Persist Profile Data,P0,Storage,Store profile data locally across app restarts.
Create Task,P0,Tasks,Allow users to create a new task.
View Task List,P0,Tasks,Display all tasks in a scrollable list.
View Task Details,P0,Tasks,Display detailed information for a selected task.
Edit Task,P0,Tasks,Allow users to modify an existing task.
Delete Task,P0,Tasks,Allow users to permanently delete a task.
Confirm Task Deletion,P1,Tasks,Ask for confirmation before deleting a task.
Mark Task as Completed,P0,Tasks,Allow users to mark a task as completed.
Mark Task as Pending,P0,Tasks,Allow users to restore a completed task.
Duplicate Task,P2,Tasks,Allow users to duplicate an existing task.
Assign Due Date,P1,Tasks,Allow users to assign an optional due date.
Remove Due Date,P2,Tasks,Allow users to remove an assigned due date.
Display Task Creation Date,P2,Tasks,Show when the task was created.
Display Last Updated Date,P2,Tasks,Show when the task was last modified.
Search Tasks by Title,P0,Search,Allow searching tasks using the title.
Search Tasks by Description,P1,Search,Allow searching tasks using the description.
Real-Time Search,P1,Search,Update search results while typing.
Filter All Tasks,P0,Filter,Display every task.
Filter Active Tasks,P0,Filter,Display only pending tasks.
Filter Completed Tasks,P0,Filter,Display only completed tasks.
Sort by Due Date,P1,Sorting,Sort tasks using due dates.
Sort by Creation Date,P1,Sorting,Sort tasks by creation date.
Sort Alphabetically,P2,Sorting,Sort tasks alphabetically.
Sort by Recently Updated,P2,Sorting,Sort tasks using the latest updated timestamp.
Display Empty State,P1,UI,Show an illustration and message when there are no tasks.
Display No Search Results,P1,UI,Show a message when search returns no results.
Show Loading Indicator,P1,UI,Display a loading indicator while loading local data.
Display Validation Errors,P0,Validation,Show validation messages for invalid inputs.
Require Task Title,P0,Validation,Prevent creating a task without a title.
Prevent Duplicate Submission,P1,Validation,Prevent duplicate task creation from multiple taps.
Persist Task Data,P0,Storage,Store tasks locally using persistent storage.
Restore Local Data,P0,Storage,Load saved tasks and profile during app startup.
Handle Corrupted Local Data,P1,Storage,Recover gracefully from corrupted local storage.
Bottom Tab Navigation,P0,Navigation,Provide navigation between Home and Profile screens.
Navigate to Task Details,P0,Navigation,Open task details from the task list.
Navigate to Edit Task,P0,Navigation,Open the edit screen from task details.
Pull to Refresh,P2,Tasks,Allow manual refresh of locally stored task data.
Application Splash Screen,P1,Application,Display splash screen while initializing the application.
First Launch Detection,P0,Application,Detect first launch and open profile setup.
Light Theme,P0,UI,Provide a clean light theme for the application.
Responsive Layout,P0,UI,Support multiple mobile screen sizes.
Accessibility Labels,P2,Accessibility,Provide accessibility labels for interactive elements.
Offline Operation,P0,Application,Allow complete application usage without internet.